            <ArticleTitle>How a footballer got hurt without getting hit: isolated peroneal compartment syndrome of a non-traumatic cause.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>W1-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Compartment syndrome can present atypically both on history and examination, so any sudden isolated muscle pain of a compartmental distribution should be regarded with a high index of suspicion to optimise the outcome for the patient.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
